# Commit-surface boundary for this research toolkit.
#
# Two kinds of content live here and they are separated by directory, not by a
# list of file names. A name list has to be maintained in step with the
# generator and silently fails open when it drifts.
#
#   authored/**   Written by a person or a model, reviewed, and committed.
#   public/**     Written by the toolkit and committed. The only generated
#                 commit surface, defined by PUBLICATION-POLICY.md.
#   everything    Runtime staging. Never committed beyond a .gitkeep
#   below         placeholder that records the directory's existence.
#
# public/** and authored/** are deliberately absent from this file: they are
# tracked, so no rule is needed.

inventory/*
!inventory/.gitkeep

private/*
!private/.gitkeep

work/*
!work/.gitkeep

reports/*
!reports/.gitkeep
